HANDOFF.md

# Brand-kit source artifact (seeded into src/tokens.css + src/fonts.css on
# 2026-06-05, see ADR 0026). The Departure Mono woff2 is self-contained in
# fonts.css, so this downloaded reference sheet isn't needed at runtime.
brand-kit-blueprint.html

# Figma wireframe reference exports (design refs, not site content)
.figma-ref/

# Transient Tokens Import proposals (Vibe mode writes here before commit).
# Always deleted on Commit/Discard; gitignored so an in-flight proposal
# never lands in version control by accident. The committed sibling,
# .loomling/tokens.original.css (pre-import baseline), DOES get tracked.
.loomling/tokens.proposed.css
